## Suggested study order

Work through the micro-topics in order. For each one, read the explanation, note unfamiliar terms, and write a short summary in your own words. You can study at your own pace and return to the last topic you completed.

## Completion check

You are ready to move on when you can explain the key ideas in this section and describe how cybersecurity, information security, IT security, privacy, and resilience are related but not identical.

